{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35864","headline":"和友人喜相遇十首 二 · 李咸用","name":"和友人喜相遇十首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"揣情摩意已无功，只把篇章助国风。\n宋玉谩夸云雨会，谢连宁许梦魂通。\n愁成旅鬓千丝乱，吟得寒缸短焰终。\n难世好居郊野地，出门常喜与人同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35864.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35864","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}